{
  "description": "PROPOSAL/CONTRACT — #1468 external verifier receipt consumer candidate. A repository consumer may validate closed schema, exact command-candidate binding, one-time challenge, bounded freshness, and caller-supplied replay absence, but may not treat receipt claims as strong authority until receipt signature/origin and independent verifier execution are separately authenticated.",
